+## Backfill stalled cards
+
+Fizzy detects activity bursts as they happen. After upgrading an existing installation,
+you can also run `bin/rails cards:backfill_activity_bursts` in the app environment to
+recognize bursts from existing assignments, events, and comments. The task uses each
+board's current auto-close setting and does not change when cards were last active.
